t(56, 350, """A picture from the future, by Allah's leave .. A picture for awareness .. not so that you leave your places now .. In the picture, Arab families in a port in southern Europe preparing to travel to the coasts of North Africa after the end of the central military operations in the Mediterranean region in the Third World War!""")

t(56, 1525, """O Arabs, wherever you are in the west of the earth .. As long as you are in the age of the current international order you will not enjoy any stability .. You will be tossed about in Allah's lands east and west and will obtain only temporary sedatives .. Stability for years here .. and stability for years here .. All of it only tranquillizers and sedatives .. All of it patching a wide tear that cannot be sewn up; rather, whenever it is stitched on one side, another new rip appears in another place .. And you remain in this state like this .. Your circumstances settle you now in the west and now in the west; after Trump's appearance you will stay only a little and will begin preparing to return. For what is coming is poverty, the collapse of the governments of the West and the collapse of the Western social system, a painful and bad collapse, and the results of that will not be good for you .. So today do not leave your homes, your jobs or your lives .. do not depart from there .. But only .. get ready, nothing more; for this picture in the post you will see as reality, and Allah knows best, with your own eyes!""")

